Third-party data: LiteLLM model prices

pkg/pricecatalog/snapshot.json is a trimmed extract of
model_prices_and_context_window.json from the LiteLLM project
(https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm), taken at the commit and date recorded
in the "meta" object of that file. Only token prices, context windows and
source links for a subset of providers are kept; the values are copied
unchanged and converted to exact decimals per million tokens.

LiteLLM licenses content outside its enterprise/ directory under the MIT
licence below. The data file lives at the repository root, not under
enterprise/. The licence text is reproduced exactly as published at the
pinned commit (pkg/pricecatalog/LICENSE.litellm is the same text).

The prices are a third-party snapshot: they can be stale or wrong, they are
public list prices, and they do not reflect discounts or commitments.

